SUMMARY:A library for testing engineering decisions
DESCRIPTION:LinkedIn\n\nA library for testing engineering decisions\n\nI pu
 t together open tools and materials to turn architecture discussions into 
 experiments: a JSON comparator\, .env key checker\, queue simulator and Ty
 peScript worker starter.\n\nThe five-minute route is simple: compare two c
 ontracts\, generate overload and run the starter tests. Each resource stat
 es its limits\; the simulation uses no production data. Materials are avai
 lable in Portuguese\, English and Spanish.\n\nWhich of these decisions com
 es up most often in your team? Start with the kit and choose one experimen
 t.\n\nhttps://lagrotti.dev/en/recursos/campanhas/kit-engenharia?utm_source
 =linkedin&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=biblioteca-2026-10&utm_content=d0
 1-kit-en
URL:https://lagrotti.dev/en/recursos/campanhas/kit-engenharia?utm_source=li
 nkedin&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=biblioteca-2026-10&utm_content=d01-k
 it-en
STATUS:TENTATIVE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
