SUMMARY:A decision you can revisit
DESCRIPTION:WhatsApp\n\nA decision you can revisit\n\nAn ADR template for c
 ontext\, alternatives\, decision and consequences. My favorite part is the
  review condition: what would need to change for this choice to stop makin
 g sense? Download it and fill it in as plain text.\n\nhttps://lagrotti.dev
 /en/recursos/templates/adr?utm_source=whatsapp&utm_medium=messaging&utm_ca
 mpaign=biblioteca-2026-10&utm_content=d06-adr-en
URL:https://lagrotti.dev/en/recursos/templates/adr?utm_source=whatsapp&utm_
 medium=messaging&utm_campaign=biblioteca-2026-10&utm_content=d06-adr-en
