SUMMARY:Study material: a 60-minute architecture workshop
DESCRIPTION:Newsletter pitch\n\nSubject: Study material: a 60-minute archit
 ecture workshop\n\nHello\, editorial team.\n\nI would like to suggest mate
 rial for a study or team activities section: a 60-minute workshop on compa
 ring alternatives and writing an ADR supported by a capacity experiment.\n
 \nSuggested blurb: “One problem\, one simulation and one recorded decisi
 on. Work alone or in pairs with a browser and text editor.”\n\nThe guide
  includes timing\, exercises\, expected outcomes and an answer key. The sc
 enario is fictional and requires no registration. It is an available propo
 sal and self-guided material\, with no claim of a previous presentation or
  class. The link provides context and downloads for review.\n\nThank you\,
 \nYago Lagrotti Bracco\n\nhttps://lagrotti.dev/en/recursos/palestras/arqui
 tetura?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=biblioteca-2026
 -10&utm_content=d19-pitch-oficina-en
URL:https://lagrotti.dev/en/recursos/palestras/arquitetura?utm_source=newsl
