SUMMARY:Quick configuration review
DESCRIPTION:WhatsApp\n\nQuick configuration review\n\nBefore testing\, crea
 te two synthetic .env files: a reference with API_URL and WORKER_TOKEN\, a
 nd another with API_URL repeated. The checker shows the missing key and du
 plicate without reproducing values in the report. Here is the tool.\n\nhtt
 ps://lagrotti.dev/en/recursos/ferramentas/env?utm_source=whatsapp&utm_medi
 um=messaging&utm_campaign=biblioteca-2026-10&utm_content=d20-env-check-en
