SUMMARY:Open invitation: reproduce a benchmark with a method
DESCRIPTION:Developer community\n\nOpen invitation: reproduce a benchmark w
 ith a method\n\nI opened a brief for reproducing the JSON cloning experime
 nt on another runtime and comparing results with the same method. The mate
 rial includes the script\, samples and limitations.\n\nA useful contributi
 on states runtime version\, system\, CPU\, command and raw samples using s
 ynthetic data. Before comparing\, check object sizes and each API's semant
 ic guarantees. Differences can motivate hypotheses\; they do not prove a u
 niversal rule.\n\nThe brief explains review and credit. There are no confi
 rmed coauthors\; any joint publication depends on methodology review and p
 articipant permission. If this kind of reproduction interests you\, read t
 he scope and propose a contribution.\n\nhttps://lagrotti.dev/en/recursos/c
 olaboracoes/reproduzir-benchmark?utm_source=community&utm_medium=social&ut
 m_campaign=biblioteca-2026-10&utm_content=d24-benchmark-colab-en
