UID:d28-decisao-en-biblioteca-2026-10@lagrotti.dev
DTSTAMP:20261017T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261116
SUMMARY:Replace “it is better” with an observable condition
DESCRIPTION:LinkedIn\n\nReplace “it is better” with an observable condi
 tion\n\nA useful ADR does not end with the technology choice. It records t
 he constraint\, the rejected alternative and the signal that would make th
 e team reconsider.\n\nIn the workshop's fictional scenario\, a condition m
 ight be: if backlog does not drain within the product's required time\, re
 visit capacity and admission policy. The number must come from a requireme
 nt or experiment\, with visible assumptions.\n\nThe template is available 
 as plain text for adaptation. Take a recent decision: which consequence wa
 s accepted consciously\, and what evidence would show its cost has grown t
 oo high?\n\nhttps://lagrotti.dev/en/recursos/templates/adr?utm_source=link
 edin&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=biblioteca-2026-10&utm_content=d28-dec
 isao-en
URL:https://lagrotti.dev/en/recursos/templates/adr?utm_source=linkedin&utm_
 medium=social&utm_campaign=biblioteca-2026-10&utm_content=d28-decisao-en
STATUS:TENTATIVE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
