UID:d29-comunidade-en-biblioteca-2026-10@lagrotti.dev
DTSTAMP:20261017T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261116
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261117
SUMMARY:Used a resource? Show a verifiable application
DESCRIPTION:Developer community\n\nUsed a resource? Show a verifiable appli
 cation\n\nThe library has an open invitation for anyone who applies a reso
 urce in a public demonstration. A useful proposal shows which resource was
  used\, what was adapted and how another person can verify the result.\n\n
 It could be a deduplication test\, an ADR with a reproducible experiment o
 r a contract comparison using synthetic data. Include a public link\, pref
 erred credit and publication permission. Share no third-party personal dat
 a or confidential material.\n\nProposals are reviewed\; submission does no
 t guarantee publication. The page explains the process and lets you prepar
 e and review a proposal before sending. Which adaptation would make the re
 source more useful in your context?\n\nhttps://lagrotti.dev/en/recursos/co
 munidade/sua-aplicacao?utm_source=community&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign
 =biblioteca-2026-10&utm_content=d29-comunidade-en
